# Python bytecode cache (e.g. from importing scripts/validate.py in tests)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
supabase/.temp

# Git worktrees parked inside the checkout. Section 8 has each batch build in
# its own worktree from a clean main, and the convenient place to put one is
# beside the repository it came from. Untracked, they showed as several hundred
# phantom pages in git status and on the manifest walk. Ignoring them keeps the
# working tree readable; scripts/validate.py enumerates tracked pages so the
# manifest is safe either way.
.wt/
